OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after injuring
OL,4,Apedestrians in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for
OL,7,Ftwo-and-a-half years after he left
OL,8,Fanother man with potentially
OL,9,Flife-changing injuries when he crashed
OL,10,Fhis car into him in Oxford.
OL,12,FThames Valley Police previously said
OL,13,FRomario Qatja, from Oxford, had mounted
OL,14,Fthe pavement and ran into two men in
OL,15,Ftheir 20s on St Clements on 13
OL,16,FSeptember 2025.
OL,18,FThe two pedestrians were taken to
OL,19,Fhospital after being hit by the grey
OL,20,FMercedes Qatja had been driving.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
